\import{base-macros}

\title{Disco}

\p{[Disco](https://github.com/disco-lang/disco) is a functional
teaching language for [discrete mathematics](0020), implemented in
Haskell.  [[heinrichapfelmus]] recently built a [basic web
UI](https://disco-lang.github.io/disco-live/) for students to be able
to use Disco in their browser, and I'm using it to teach [[0020]] this semester.}

